# Agent scratch: the decisions these record belong in the code they describe.
/.remember/
/.egm/*
!/.egm/*_DRIFT_REPORT.md
!/.egm/DRIFT_STATUS.md
!/.egm/CONTRACTS.index
/docs/designs/
/.worktrees/

# EGM artifacts. The EGM.md contracts are tracked: they are what the code
# says about itself, they are reviewed in the diff, and the CI gate checks
# them on a fresh checkout. tests/package_contents.rs keeps them out of the
# published crates. Everything else in .egm/ is working scratch and stays
# ignored, except the dated drift reports, DRIFT_STATUS.md (audit trail) and
# CONTRACTS.index (generated lockfile of derived facts). The plugin's global
# default is .dev/docs; ignore it too rather than let a stray global run
# commit its drafts into the tree.
/.dev/docs/

# The working notes of this repository are in the tree, not out of it: they
# are what the code says about itself, and the commit that changes the code
# carries the note that says why it changed.
